&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with payments platforms, card processing, 3DS/SCA, PSP integrations, token vaulting, or multi-jurisdiction compliance constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience owning a frontend platform, such as design systems, golden paths, performance budgets, embedded/iframe journeys, or micro-frontend architectures used by multiple squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with native mobile delivery across iOS/Android alongside web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience modernising and migrating experiences market-by-market whilst maintaining business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience introducing personalisation or experimentation into a customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience adopting agentic AI or AI-assisted engineering practices in production teams, including coding agents, workflow automation, AI-enabled observability, or internal developer productivity improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
