&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deine teamorientierte Persönlichkeit und deine ausgezeichneten kommunikativen Fähigkeiten werden in unserem dynamischen Team geschätzt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Erfahrung mit agilen Entwicklungsmethoden wie Scrum oder Kanban ist von Vorteil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Kenntnisse im Umgang mit BSI-Software sind wünschenswert, aber nicht zwingend erforderlich.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wir suchen nach Kandidaten, die Interesse haben, sich aktiv in unserer CRM- und BSI-Community zu engagieren und ihr Wissen zu teilen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bereit für den nächsten Schritt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn das nach dir klingt, würden wir uns freuen, von dir zu hören. Dies ist eine Gelegenheit, einen Unterschied zu machen und zu einem äußerst erfolgreichen Unternehmen mit einem signifikanten Wachstumskurs beizutragen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Joining Capco means joining an organization that is committed to an inclusive working environment where you’re encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We celebrate individuality and recognize that diversity and inclusion, in all forms, is critical to success. It’s important to us that we recruit and develop as diverse a range of talent as we can and we believe that everyone brings something different to the table – so we’d love to know what makes you different. Such differences may mean we need to make changes to our process to allow you the best possible platform to succeed, and we are happy to cater to any reasonable adjustments you may require. You will find the section to let us know of these at the bottom of your application form or you can mention it directly to your recruiter at any stage and they will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and management consultancy dedicated to the financial services industry. We combine innovative thinking with unrivalled industry knowledge, to offer our clients consulting expertise, complex technology and package integration, transformation delivery and managed services to move their organizations forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We specialize primarily in banking &amp;amp; payments, capital markets, wealth &amp;amp; asset management, insurance and energy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a collaborative and efficient approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We help our clients successfully innovate, increase revenue, manage risk and regulatory change, reduce costs and enhance controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We serve our clients from 32 offices across the Americas, Europe, and Asia Pacific&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If creativity and innovation are your passion, then Capco is right for you. You can grow in an inclusive, diverse and collaborative environment. At Capco, we will train and support you to help accelerate your career.&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW202573807 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a (Senior) Consultant / Business Engineer – Data at Capco, you will work with financial services clients to turn complex business and technology challenges into clear, practical solutions. You will operate at the intersection of Business, IT, Data, CRM and Architecture, helping clients improve processes, data landscapes and ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to transformation, optimisation, data, master data and CRM initiatives, translating requirements into concepts, specifications, user stories and decision-ready recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;YOUR CAPCO DAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse complex business and technical requirements and translate them into clear concepts, specifications, user stories and decision materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to transformation, optimisation, data, master data and CRM initiatives across financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across business functions, IT teams, architects and project stakeholders, connecting Business, IT, Data, CRM and Architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse system landscapes, application architectures, data flows, data quality, governance and processes to identify practical opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce complexity and develop pragmatic solutions that meet both business and technology needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;YOUR CAPCO-FIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:254}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Business Analyst, Consultant, IT Consultant or Requirements Engineer, ideally with around three or more years of experience in financial services, banking, insurance or an enterprise environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of system landscapes, application architectures, data flows, master data, CRM processes, data quality, governance and process optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex business and technical topics, structure requirements and turn them into clear, practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to work effectively across Business, IT, Data, CRM, Architecture and project teams in dynamic environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good German skills, ideally C1/C2 level, and good English skills, ideally B2 level or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CAPCO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A career at Capco is a chance to help reshape the competitive landscape in financial services. We launch new banks, transform existing ones, and help our clients navigate complex change. As consultants, we work on the front-end business design all the way through to technology implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the largest Financial Services focused consultancy in the world, serving everyone from global banks to emerging FinTechs, from strategy through digital transformation, design, business consulting, data and analytics, cyber, cloud, technology architecture, and engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a young and growing firm. We maintain an entrepreneurial spirit and growth mindset, and have minimal bureaucracy. We have no internal silos that get in the way of your career opportunities or ability to focus on our clients and make a difference to the business. We offer the opportunity for everyone to learn rapidly, take on tough challenges, and get promoted quickly. We take pride in our creative, collaborative, diverse, and inclusive culture, where everyone can #BYAW.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer highly competitive benefits, flexible working hours, technical and soft skills training, smartphone &amp;amp; fast mobile internet and a work culture focused on innovation and creation of lasting value for our clients and employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. &amp;nbsp;This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Joining Capco means joining an organization that is committed to an inclusive working environment where you’re encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We celebrate individuality and recognize that diversity and inclusion, in all forms, is critical to success. It’s important to us that we recruit and develop as diverse a range of talent as we can and we believe that everyone brings something different to the table – so we’d love to know what makes you different. Such differences may mean we need to make changes to our process to allow you the best possible platform to succeed, and we are happy to cater to any reasonable adjustments you may require. You will find the section to let us know of these at the bottom of your application form or you can mention it directly to your recruiter at any stage and they will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and management consultancy dedicated to the financial services industry. We combine innovative thinking with unrivalled industry knowledge, to offer our clients consulting expertise, complex technology and package integration, transformation delivery and managed services to move their organizations forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We specialize primarily in banking &amp;amp; payments, capital markets, wealth &amp;amp; asset management, insurance and energy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a collaborative and efficient approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We help our clients successfully innovate, increase revenue, manage risk and regulatory change, reduce costs and enhance controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We serve our clients from 32 offices across the Americas, Europe, and Asia Pacific&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If creativity and innovation are your passion, then Capco is right for you. You can grow in an inclusive, diverse and collaborative environment. At Capco, we will train and support you to help accelerate your career.&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW202573807 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior / Principal Consultant, you will play a key role in the functional design and further development of modern Management Reporting and Management Information Systems for Retail Banking, Corporate Banking, Private Banking, Wealth Management and Asset Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting as a Business Functional Analyst at the intersection of Business, Data, and IT, you will ensure that business requirements are translated into sustainable management reporting and steering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will advise our clients on defining banking KPIs, enhancing reporting processes, and modernizing existing MIS landscapes. In addition to contributing your functional expertise, you will actively support client development, project management, and the continued development of our Banking Consulting capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO DAY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise local and international banks on the development and enhancement of Management Information Systems and reporting landscapes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take functional ownership as a Business Functional Analyst, working across Business, Data, and IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, harmonize, and further develop banking KPIs for Retail Banking, Corporate Banking, Private Banking, Wealth Management and Asset Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex business requirements into functional concepts, reporting logic, and functional requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize reporting processes and data journeys across the entire reporting value chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and facilitate workshops with business divisions/functions and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing, KPI validation, and the implementation of new reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO FIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5–6 years of experience in consulting or in a business function within a private bank&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Reporting and Management Information Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of products and processes within Retail Banking, Corporate Banking, Private Banking, Wealth Management and/or Asset Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Business Analyst or Functional Analyst in regulatory or business transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good knowledge of banking KPIs, management reporting, and sales steering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Business, Data, and IT stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating workshops and managing stakeholders at management level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and structured approach, combined with well-developed consulting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience transforming global reporting and MIS landscapes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating MIS and reporting systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud data platforms and modern BI architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing stakeholders at senior/executive management level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CAPCO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A career at Capco is a chance to help reshape the competitive landscape in financial services. We launch new banks, transform existing ones, and help our clients navigate complex change. As consultants, we work on the front-end business design all the way through to technology implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the largest Financial Services focused consultancy in the world, serving everyone from global banks to emerging FinTechs, from strategy through digital transformation, design, business consulting, data and analytics, cyber, cloud, technology architecture, and engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a young and growing firm. We maintain an entrepreneurial spirit and growth mindset, and have minimal bureaucracy. We have no internal silos that get in the way of your career opportunities or ability to focus on our clients and make a difference to the business. We offer the opportunity for everyone to learn rapidly, take on tough challenges, and get promoted quickly. We take pride in our creative, collaborative, diverse, and inclusive culture, where everyone can #BYAW.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer highly competitive benefits, flexible working hours, technical and soft skills training, smartphone &amp;amp; fast mobile internet and a work culture focused on innovation and creation of lasting value for our clients and employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. &amp;nbsp;This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Joining Capco means joining an organisation that is committed to an inclusive working environment where you’re encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We celebrate individuality and recognize that diversity and inclusion, in all forms, is critical to success. It’s important to us that we recruit and develop as diverse a range of talent as we can and we believe that everyone brings something different to the table – so we’d love to know what makes you different. Such differences may mean we need to make changes to our process to allow you the best possible platform to succeed, and we are happy to cater to any reasonable adjustments you may require. You will find the section to let us know of these at the bottom of your application form or you can mention it directly to your recruiter at any stage and they will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
