&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the forefront of digital communications, driving the integration of Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO), Digital PR, and Search Engine Optimisation (SEO) strategy. As Associate Director in the Digital Marketing function at Burson, you will shape how brands are discovered, represented, and trusted across AI-driven environments. You will act as a strategic advisor to clients, while driving innovation, commercial growth, and cross-functional collaboration within the agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of GEO strategies for key clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex AI and search concepts into clear, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on brand visibility, sentiment, and risk in AI-generated search results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and evolve GEO frameworks, tools, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate GEO best practices into PR campaigns to secure high quality coverage and citations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate SEO, content, and PR strategies to maximise search and AI visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the upskilling of cross-functional teams across the fundamentals of GEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business growth through client development, pitches, and new service offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in GEO, Digital PR and/or SEO is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion and curiosity around the evolution of GEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SEO and content optimisation principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust understanding of what good looks like in earned media and digital PR campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating data and technical concepts into client-friendly strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest or experience in AI, generative search, or emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of developing and pitching innovative client solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams and collaborating across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial mindset with the ability to identify growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client service excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LINE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Graduate Programme — Scale Space&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you torn between the excitement of start-ups and the stability of corporate life?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you keen to continue learning and developing skills whilst experiencing how to build businesses?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you looking for a role that will offer the opportunity to experience first-hand how a growing business operates, while being supported to take ownership of work that matters?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you and you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking to hire high-energy, entrepreneurial and value-adding graduate talent to join Blenheim Chalcot in a role dedicated entirely to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;, one of the businesses within the Blenheim Chalcot portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure. Our ventures are at the forefront of a multitude of industries being disrupted by digital, including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are highly entrepreneurial and seek opportunities where digital technologies can disrupt major markets. Ventures we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance, Modulr and the Rajasthan Royals cricket team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Many of the companies within the portfolio have materialised from ideas conceived and launched by us, and we have over 4,000 employees supporting their growth and development. Our assets under management stand at more than £1.8bn and total portfolio revenue is over £500 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We work closely with investment and strategic partners including PayPal, FIS, L&amp;amp;G, Tencent, Experian, Google, Worldpay, Imperial College and some of the leading venture capital and private equity companies internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our central team, Venture Builder Services (VBS), exists to support our ventures to be successful quickly, sustainably and with access to best-practice tools, solutions and expertise. We provide a range of services to help new businesses get off the ground, including technology, growth, talent, finance, legal and tax.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;IMPACT BEYOND PROFIT&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;15% of our partnerships and ventures are charities. These include the British Asian Trust, Babyzone and OnSide Youth Zones. In the same way that we support our ventures, our Partners provide direct hands-on support to these charities by being active board members and offering expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT SCALE SPACE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Scale Space is a community and workspace designed to bring together ambitious businesses, entrepreneurs, scale-ups and innovators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Based in White City, Scale Space provides more than just flexible workspace. It creates an environment where growing businesses can connect, collaborate and access the networks, expertise and opportunities they need to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The team works across community, events, partnerships, operations and customer experience to ensure that members receive a high-quality experience while helping to build a connected and ambitious business community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced and progressive environment while working exclusively with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will be embedded within the Scale Space team and contribute to meaningful projects across the business, while benefiting from Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning, development and employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated to Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your role will sit fully within Scale Space. Your day-to-day work, projects and objectives will be focused entirely on supporting Scale Space and its growth, giving you the opportunity to build deep experience within a fast-moving and entrepreneurial business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we pride ourselves on having an intentional and continuous learning and development culture at Blenheim Chalcot. You will have access to BC learning and development opportunities designed to strengthen your core professional, commercial and leadership skills, while applying that learning directly to your work at Scale Space. You will learn by doing, taking on real responsibility and developing quickly within the Scale Space team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Careers Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– as a BC graduate, you will have access to structured development opportunities designed for those early in their careers. These will support your professional growth while your substantive role remains fully dedicated to Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be part of the wider BC graduate community, with access to relevant learning sessions, networking opportunities and socials. This community is intended to support your development and connection with fellow graduates; your substantive role and day-to-day responsibilities will remain entirely within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset and supported to take ownership of work that matters. Rather than rotating between businesses, you will build continuity and depth within Scale Space and see the direct impact of your work on the business, its members and the wider community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ARE YOU BC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are not expecting you to have worked in start-ups before or to have studied a tech-related degree. For us, it is about hiring the right person and their potential, not just their experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As such, we are looking for graduates from any discipline. Different areas of expertise bring valuable new perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people when hiring into the BC Group. We look for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– people in BC are inquisitive. They want to understand ‘why’ and consider whether there is a better approach rather than simply accepting ‘it’s how we’ve always done it’. Given our ethos is all about disrupting industries with new methods and products, curiosity is at the heart of what we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‘Doers’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we are a community of proactive self-starters. We will provide full support to our graduates, but we look for people who can use their initiative, take ownership and drive work forward on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– working in a growth business environment is ambiguous, diverse and, at times, chaotic by definition. Being adaptable and recognising the importance of flexibility in order to add value in a constantly evolving company is vital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiasm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you do not need to be a ‘techy’ at heart to work in our environment. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about innovation, growth and the changing nature of industries, with a desire to work in an environment where new and challenging things happen every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– building and scaling businesses is never easy. As such, we have a ‘no-ego’ policy and seek out people who bring energy to a team rather than drain it. We have a down-to-earth and personable culture; we solve complex problems but do not take ourselves too seriously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the UK’s leading digital venture builder and have the opportunity to learn from the incredible talent across BC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be exposed to the right mix of challenge, responsibility and learning and development opportunities while building deep, hands-on experience within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fun and open, if a little cricket-obsessed, atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holiday plus your birthday off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance, Pension Scheme and Cycle to Work Scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Benefits including Private Medical and Dental cover and gym subsidies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; PROCESS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will contact you with next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a rigorous recruitment process, which we use for all our roles to ensure we attract the very best talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a three-stage process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Telephone interview with a member of the BC Talent Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Virtual assessment day, consisting of both individual and group activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 3:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Final interviews with Blenheim Chalcot and Scale Space at Scale Space, White City.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the timeframes provided above are subject to change. Any changes will be communicated throughout the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values and is central to our business. We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We encourage diversity of perspective, background, identity and thought, while fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to continuing to nurture an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Adanola and Huel use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform — and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Intelligence team are responsible for ensuring our customers take action on Fospha data: turning data into clear recommendations, guiding marketers through budgeting decisions and helping client teams become experts in the Fospha platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the entry point into the function, and it is a hands-on one. You&#39;ll work across live customer accounts from the point that they go live with Fospha, becoming the trusted expert in the domain, our customers and the decisions they are making across their marketing mix. It&#39;s a role for someone who wants to learn how to turn data into customer action, in a business where these actions are meaningful and exciting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: Customer Intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level&lt;/strong&gt;: Graduate - Entry Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London, White City&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll join our Customer Intelligence Team and work across customer accounts, becoming a trusted expert in the insight, model, and data quality that sit behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for the customer outcomes your team owns — driving action on insight, trust in the model, and confidence in data quality — contributing to customer retention alongside the Account Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll build deep expertise in your specialism and use it to solve real customer problems, turning data into clear recommendations, building trust in our methodology, and keeping data accurate and flowing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be confident and effective in customer-facing moments relevant to your team, building credibility with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be collaborative, working closely with Account Managers and other specialist teams, feeding customer insight back to Product, and keeping everyone aligned with regular progress updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your core responsibilities, we expect you to be excited by the opportunity Gen AI brings and find new ways of working utilising our Gen AI hub to increase our efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Centre of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Centre of Excellence is Fospha&#39;s early-careers programme that develops ambitious, high-performing talent through focused training, hands-on experience and cross-functional exposure. Starting in Customer Intelligence, you&#39;ll gain foundational experience while being prepared for future opportunities across the organisation. The programme operates on the following principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individual Responsibility from the Get-go: You will quickly be responsible for the success of your work, able to make an individual impact early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Customer Facing Expert: You will be working directly with customers, often meeting them in person and developing your ability to create strong interpersonal relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Training: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real Mentorship: Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career Development: High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within our Customer Teams toward strategic and/or management roles or moving into other departments that align with your skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Tools: Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling through our Gen AI hub, so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £34k + discretionary 10% bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension ~~through Royal London~~, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. We’re looking for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive individuals who are keen to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building ability, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, comfortable interpreting data and creating insights – proficiency in Excel!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and able to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving problems for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in emerging technologies and excited by the potential and opportunity AI brings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be hear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer at the heart: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candour with caring: We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Adanola and Huel use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform — and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Intelligence team are responsible for ensuring our customers take action on Fospha data: turning data into clear recommendations, guiding marketers through budgeting decisions and helping client teams become experts in the Fospha platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the entry point into the function, and it is a hands-on one. You&#39;ll work across live customer accounts from the point that they go live with Fospha, becoming the trusted expert in the domain, our customers and the decisions they are making across their marketing mix. It&#39;s a role for someone who wants to learn how to turn data into customer action, in a business where these actions are meaningful and exciting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: Customer Intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level&lt;/strong&gt;: Graduate - Entry Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London, White City&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll join our Customer Intelligence Team and work across customer accounts, becoming a trusted expert in the insight, model, and data quality that sit behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for the customer outcomes your team owns — driving action on insight, trust in the model, and confidence in data quality — contributing to customer retention alongside the Account Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll build deep expertise in your specialism and use it to solve real customer problems, turning data into clear recommendations, building trust in our methodology, and keeping data accurate and flowing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be confident and effective in customer-facing moments relevant to your team, building credibility with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be collaborative, working closely with Account Managers and other specialist teams, feeding customer insight back to Product, and keeping everyone aligned with regular progress updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your core responsibilities, we expect you to be excited by the opportunity Gen AI brings and find new ways of working utilising our Gen AI hub to increase our efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Centre of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Centre of Excellence is Fospha&#39;s early-careers programme that develops ambitious, high-performing talent through focused training, hands-on experience and cross-functional exposure. Starting in Customer Intelligence, you&#39;ll gain foundational experience while being prepared for future opportunities across the organisation. The programme operates on the following principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individual Responsibility from the Get-go: You will quickly be responsible for the success of your work, able to make an individual impact early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Customer Facing Expert: You will be working directly with customers, often meeting them in person and developing your ability to create strong interpersonal relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Training: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real Mentorship: Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career Development: High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within our Customer Teams toward strategic and/or management roles or moving into other departments that align with your skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Tools: Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling through our Gen AI hub, so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £34k + discretionary 10% bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension ~~through Royal London~~, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. We’re looking for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive individuals who are keen to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building ability, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, comfortable interpreting data and creating insights – proficiency in Excel!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and able to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving problems for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in emerging technologies and excited by the potential and opportunity AI brings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be hear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer at the heart: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candour with caring: We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Graduate Programme — Babyzone&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you torn between the excitement of start-ups and the stability of corporate life?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you keen to continue learning and developing skills whilst experiencing how to build businesses?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you looking for a role that will offer the opportunity to experience first-hand how a tech company is built, and be supported while taking ownership of work that matters?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you and you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire high-energy, entrepreneurial and value-adding graduate talent to join Blenheim Chalcot in a role dedicated entirely to Babyzone, one of the social-impact organisations supported by BC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure. Our ventures are at the forefront of a multitude of industries being disrupted by digital including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more. We are highly entrepreneurial and seek opportunities where digital technologies can disrupt major markets - ventures we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance, Modulr and the Rajasthan Royals cricket team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Many of the companies within the portfolio have materialised from ideas conceived and launched by us, and we have over 4,000 employees to support their growth and development. Our assets under management stand at more than £1.8bn and total portfolio revenue is over £500 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work closely with investment and strategic partners ranging from Paypal, FIS, L&amp;amp;G, Tencent, Experian, Google, WorldPay, Imperial College and some of the leading venture capital and private equity companies internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our central team, Venture Builder Services (VBS), exists to support our ventures to be successful quickly, sustainably and with access to the best practice tools, solutions, and expertise. We provide a range of services to help new business get off the ground, including technology, growth (marketing and sales), talent, finance, legal and tax.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;IMPACT BEYOND PROFIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15% of our partnerships and ventures are charities. These include the British Asian Trust,&amp;nbsp;Babyzone and Onside Youth Zones. In the same way that we support our ventures, our Partners provide direct hands-on support to these charities by being active board members and offering expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ABOUT BABYZONE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Babyzone is&amp;nbsp;an innovative and fast-growing UK early childhood charity. It runs free, open-access community hubs for families with children aged 0-5 in areas of high deprivation, bringing together services, programmes and partners to improve outcomes for young children and their families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced and progressive environment while working exclusively with Babyzone. You will be embedded within the Babyzone team and contribute to meaningful projects that support the charity&#39;s growth, operations and impact, while benefiting from Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning, development and employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated to Babyzone – although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your role will sit fully within Babyzone. Your day-to-day work, projects and objectives will be focused entirely on supporting Babyzone and its mission, giving you the opportunity to build deep experience within a fast-growing, mission-led organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development – we pride ourselves on having an intentional and continuous learning and development culture at Blenheim Chalcot. You will have access to BC learning and development opportunities designed to strengthen your core professional, commercial and leadership skills, while applying that learning directly to your work at Babyzone. You will learn by doing, taking on real responsibility and developing quickly within the Babyzone team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early Careers Development – as a BC graduate, you will have access to structured development opportunities designed for those early in their careers. These will support your professional growth while your role itself remains fully dedicated to Babyzone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate Community – you will be part of the wider BC graduate community, with access to relevant learning sessions, networking opportunities and socials. This community is intended to support your development and connection with fellow graduates; your substantive role and day-to-day responsibilities will remain entirely within Babyzone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability – you will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset and supported to take ownership of work that matters. Rather than rotating between businesses, you will build continuity and depth within Babyzone, seeing the direct impact of your work on the organisation and the families and communities it serves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ARE YOU BC?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not expecting you to have worked in start-ups before or to have studied a tech related degree. For us, it is about hiring the right person and their potential, not just their experience. As such, we are looking for graduates from any discipline – different areas of expertise are great for new perspectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people when hiring into the BC Group. We look for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– people in BC are inquisitive, they want to understand ‘why’ and consider if there is a better approach rather than take on the ‘it’s how we’ve always done it’ perspective. Given our ethos is all about disrupting industries with new methods and products, curiosity is at the heart of what we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‘Doers’&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– surprisingly, this is not a given in a lot of working environments; we are a community of pro-active self-starters. We will provide full support to our graduates, though we do look for proactive people who can use their initiative and drive on a daily basis. Working in an environment where everyone has this trait is incredibly refreshing and we strive to maintain it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;working in a growth business environment is ambiguous, diverse and, at times, chaotic by definition. Being adaptable and recognising the importance of flexibility to add value in a constantly evolving company is vital for us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiasm –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you do not need to be a ‘techy’ at heart to work in our environment. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about what digitalisation is doing to industries and a drive to work in a pioneering sector which represents that drive. A desire for doing new and challenging things makes coming into work a whole lot more fun.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– building a tech start-up is never easy. As such, we have a ‘no-ego’ policy and seek out people who bring energy to a team, not drain it. We have a down-to-earth and personable culture; we solve complex problems but do not take ourselves too seriously and look to have fun whilst doing so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the UK’s leading digital venture builder and have the opportunity to be a part of and learn from the incredible talent in BC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be exposed to the right mix of challenges and learning and development opportunities while building deep, hands-on experience within Babyzone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fun and open, if a little cricket obsessed, atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holidays + your birthday off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance, Pension Scheme, Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Benefits including Private Medical and Dental, Gym Subsidiaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will contact you with next steps. We have a rigorous recruitment process, which we use for all our roles to ensure we attract the very best talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a three-stage process that will consist of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stage 1: Telephone interview with a member of the BC Talent team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Virtual assessment day, consisting of both individual and group activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stage 3: Final interviews with Blenheim Chalcot and Babyzone at Scale Space, White City&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Please note the timeframes provided above are subject to change, which we will communicate throughout the process*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values, thus making it core to our business. We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone. We encourage diversity through perspective, background, identity, and thought whilst also fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of your race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We are committed to continuing to nurture an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper is hiring a driven, German speaking Senior Channel Account Manager to join the Keeper EMEA Channel Sales team. Qualified candidates must permanently reside in the UK (London). This is a fully remote position for those residing in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper&#39;s cybersecurity software is trusted by millions of people and thousands of organisations, globally. Keeper is published in 23 languages and is sold in over 150 countries. Join one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity companies and be responsible for building pipeline and channel revenue with high performance partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keeper&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper Security is a leading cybersecurity software company that protects thousands of organizations and millions of people in more than 150 countries. Keeper delivers a powerful zero-trust and zero-knowledge solution built to meet the stringent requirements of public sector IT environments. Its flagship offering, KeeperPAM®, is an AI-enabled, cloud-native platform that protects users, devices and critical infrastructure from cyber attacks. Recognized in the Gartner® Magic QuadrantTM for Privileged Access Management (PAM), Keeper combines robust compliance with unmatched visibility and control. With industry-leading certifications, Keeper provides the security assurance public sector organizations require. Learn why agencies trust Keeper to defend against today’s sophisticated adversaries at &lt;a href=&quot;http://keepersecurity.com&quot;&gt;KeeperSecurity.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The German speaking Senior Channel Account Manager will report to our Director of Channel, EMEA carrying a primary focus on building pipeline and channel revenue with existing channel partners. There will also be a heavy focus sourcing strategic new channel relationships. This position requires the candidate to be extremely motivated, results-driven and have a good network within the channel ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the day-to-day recruitment and relationship management of channel partners to include value added resellers, distributors, systems integrators and strategic software partners (primarily in Germany)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between Keeper and assigned channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with English and German speaking clients, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and manage relationships with current and prospective channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish productive, professional relationships with key sales and channel personnel in assigned partner accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the involvement of Keeper personnel, including support, service, and management resources, in order to meet partner performance objectives and partners’ expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell through partner organizations to end users in coordination with partner sales resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet assigned targets for profitable sales volume and strategic objectives in assigned partner accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage direct/channel conflict by fostering excellent communication between the channel and direct sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure partner compliance with Channel Partner programs and agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in a partner planning process that develops mutual performance objectives, financial targets, and critical milestones associated with a productive partner relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify partner GTM &amp;amp;/or services offerings; working with partner sales resources, marketing, etc. develop &amp;amp; launch offerings to point of incremental joint revenue achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with technology vendors to identify mutual greenfield opportunities with shared partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain channel opportunity registrations in Salesforce.com and assist the direct sales team in closing channel generated leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute on Channel Marketing activities and events to support brand awareness and demand generation with the Strategic Partner group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to and from customer meetings (locally and nationally) &amp;amp; rent and/or operate a vehicle on behalf of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of security SaaS channel sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be bilingual, native German with English fluency (both verbal and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success driving revenue growth via channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of Partner Incentive programs and PRM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and ability to excel in a team oriented atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written/verbal communications skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely motivated and goal-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must want a career-oriented environment that is both fun and professional&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare (no wait period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension contribution (no wait period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike-to-Work Scheme (if local)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Keeper Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;This notice explains how Keeper Security processes your personal data during recruitment. Depending on the role and location, the Controller of personal data (the organization responsible for determining why and how personal data is processed) will be Keeper Security Inc. (US), Keeper Security EMEA Ltd. (Ireland), or Keeper Security APAC K.K (Japan).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 1. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Data We Collect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information You provide:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Contact details, CV/resume, cover letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Employment history, qualifications, work eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Application responses and uploaded documents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information We generate:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Interview notes, assessments, communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Scheduling information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information From Others:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Recruiter/referral information who submit your profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;References (with your consent, before final offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Public professional profiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Background verification (post offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; Voluntary Diversity and Equal Opportunity Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We may ask you to voluntarily provide diversity information including race/ethnicity, gender, disability status and veteran status (US). Providing this information is optional and Keeper collects this data in order to comply with EEOC and similar requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;How We Use Your Data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Assess your application and suitability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Manage interviews and recruitment workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Consider you for other/future roles (we may seek your consent to keep your information on our systems beyond the retention period specified)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Comply with employment law obligations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 3. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Legal Basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Legitimate Interests (recruitment management, security and integrity of the hiring process)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Contracting steps (for progressed candidates)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Legal and regulatory compliance obligations; explicit consent where required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 4. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Who We Share Information With&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Internal: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;HR, hiring managers, interviewers*, IT support for system administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;*Note - diversity and equal opportunity data is not shared with hiring managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Third Parties:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Service providers who assist with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Applicant tracking, recruitment systems and assessment providers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Background verification vendors (post offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Recruitment agencies (where applicable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Tools to support communication, collaboration and to securely store your data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Keeper ensures that all our third parties are contractually bound to protect your personal data with adequate safeguards in place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 5. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;International Transfers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Your data may be accessed by Keeper entities globally as needed for the purposes of hiring and decision making. We protect any such data transfer between Keeper entities using appropriate safeguards under applicable data protection laws. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;6. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data, consistent with our industry leading security standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;7. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Retention&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We keep your data for 24 months from your last application activity, then delete or anonymize it. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Exceptions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You opt into our talent database for further retention by providing consent (extended retention)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You&#39;re hired (transfers to employee records)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 8. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Your Rights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You have the following rights and can contact us at the email below to exercise them:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Access, correct, or delete your data, subject to applicable law and retention requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Object to or restrict processing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Withdraw consent (where applicable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Request data portability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Lodge a complaint with your data protection authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;If you become an employee, your rights regarding your employee record are governed by our internal Employee Privacy Notice and certain data will be retained as required under relevant laws such as employment or tax law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;When you request access to your personal data, some information may be redacted if it includes the personal data of other individuals or information that we must protect in order to preserve their privacy rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 9. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Automated Decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Keeper does not make hiring decisions using solely automated processing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;10. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Contact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; - Candidates can send privacy questions to: -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a People Director to help lead our Europe business through its next phase of growth. We need someone who can work alongside our European leadership team to shape the business, build leadership capability, retain exceptional talent, and ensure our People strategy evolves ahead of the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will lead the People team across the UK and Portugal and play an important role in connecting Europe to Indicium AI’s global business strategy, People priorities and ways of working. You will represent the needs of the Europe business globally while helping translate our global objectives into regional priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires someone who is highly visible in the business, builds credibility and relationships quickly, brings the the confidence and judgment to influence senior leaders, and can introduce the right level of structure without creating unnecessary bureaucracy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead and develop our existing Europe People team and work closely with our Global People and Talent team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role with a minimum of three days per week in the office, plus regular travel to Lisbon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the People strategy across the UK and Portugal, aligned with Europe and global business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help lead Europe through its next stage of scale, anticipating the organisational, leadership and talent capabilities needed as the business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Europe to the global business, translating global priorities into regional People priorities while representing Europe’s needs in global decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong, trusted relationships across the business, becoming a credible adviser to leaders on both business and People decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen leadership and management capability, coaching leaders through performance, organisational challenges, change and difficult people decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and retain exceptional talent, particularly across our technical and consulting teams, through career development, performance, compensation, succession and workforce planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continued growth of Portugal, ensuring we have the right organisation, leadership, talent practices and culture as the Lisbon team scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and develop the Europe People team, creating opportunities for the team to grow while maintaining ownership and autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable People practices without over-engineering them, continuously improving core People processes, systems, reporting and ways of working as the organisation grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead organisational change and manage People risk, including employee relations and other transformations, balancing employee experience with commercial realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive People/HR experience, with leadership responsibility and autonomy in a high-growth professional services organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work from our office at 100 Liverpool Street in London, UK and travel to Lisbon, Portugal regularly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience helping an organisation navigate a meaningful stage of growth, including evolving its organisational structure, leadership capability and People model as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience partnering directly with senior executives and the credibility and judgment to influence business and organizational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the dynamics of a professional services organisation, including the relationship between talent, utilisation, capability, client delivery and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and retaining technical or specialist talent, including career frameworks, performance management, succession planning and compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading, mentoring and developing People professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience across organisational design, workforce planning, organisational change and employee relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting teams across multiple countries and navigating the balance between global consistency and local requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK employment law. Experience supporting employees and leaders in Portugal and/or internationally is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable shaping strategy with senior leaders and rolling up your sleeves when the business needs it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in an environment where priorities move quickly, not every answer is known upfront, and progress often comes through testing, learning and adapting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Indicium AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-growing start-up organisation with huge opportunity for career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive salary package along with company bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hugely collaborative working environment where every person’s viewpoint is considered - a chance to make your mark on the business from day one!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financially backed business meaning security and support for new initiatives and global market expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick your own Gear! Macbooks, PCs, Accessories!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive your development with a personal learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;Role: Talent Executive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;Division: Nutrition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;Brand: Myprotein&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;Reporting to: Talent Acquisition Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (fully office based)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;353&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Talent Executive, you’ll support recruitment across Myprotein HQ, partnering with hiring managers to understand their teams, the skills they need, and what makes someone successful in each role. Your work will span the full hiring process: shaping briefs, finding and engaging candidates, managing interviews, and helping teams make confident hiring decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your focus will be on Head Office and commercial vacancies. That means building relationships across different functions, adapting your approach to each search, and developing a strong understanding of the talent market. You’ll report to the Talent Acquisition Manager, who will support your development and help you take increasing ownership of your roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Talent Aquisition Executive You&#39;ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers across Myprotein HQ to understand hiring needs and agree clear, realistic role briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and manage recruitment for Head Office and commercial positions, from initial search through to offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headhunt candidates who might not be actively looking but could be excited by what we’re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and screen talent, looking beyond the CV to understand people’s skills, ambition, and potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships and talent pipelines that put us in a stronger position for the next hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep interviews moving, feedback flowing, and candidates and hiring managers in the loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights on the talent market to help teams make smart hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruitment data to track progress and find ways to make our process better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Talent Acquisition Manager on sourcing strategies, hiring priorities, and a candidate experience that feels unmistakably Myprotein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 12 months’ recruitment experience, gained in an agency or an in-house talent acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting recruitment processes and managing relationships with candidates and hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to ask good questions, understand a brief, and adapt your search when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to finding talent beyond incoming applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and attention to detail, with the ability to manage several vacancies and deadlines at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, engaging communication and a genuine commitment to giving candidates a great experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring into commercial functions would be particularly valuable. Exposure to direct-to-consumer (DTC) businesses, ecommerce, or international hiring is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
